; Typical process memory layout 
;
; Low addresses
; +-----------------------------+
; | Text / code                 | Executable instructions
; | Read-only data              | Constants and string literals
; | Initialized data            | Initialized globals and statics
; | BSS                         | Zero-initialized globals/statics
; | Heap                        | Dynamic allocations; usually grows upward
; |                             |
; | Unmapped / shared regions   | Mappings vary by OS and process
; |                             |
; | Stack                       | Calls and local variables; usually grows downward
; +-----------------------------+
; High addresses
;
; Actual placement varies by platform, executable format, and ASLR.
